<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our Brother’s inherited all</l><l>God made Him to rule His affairs</l><l>Appointed—this office He fills</l><l>And shares it with us, His joint-heirs.</l><l>Elected before earth was formed,</l><l>We’ve found that we are qualified</l><l>To share all His glory and worth.</l><l>How could men but for Christ decide?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Yes, we’re holy brothers with Christ,</l><l>No higher could any man be.</l><l>This highest of all gospels is;</l><l>This gospel each human must see.</l><l>Partakers of this heavenly call,</l><l>Could any this gospel reject?</l><l>With Christ sitting far above all—</l><l>This highest of all gospels yet!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
